{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A relaxing mushroom-foraging simulator that immerses you in a peaceful forest atmosphere through meditative gameplay. If you miss mushroom picking\u2014or have never tried it\u2014here\u2019s your chance to escape the city bustle and find inner peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Numerous mushroom species await you</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From chanterelles and porcini to russulas and toadstools\u2014collect everything in sight or hunt only for valuable specimens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460890/extras/gif1.gif?t=1749746234\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Pickle your mushrooms</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A single mushroom, a whole batch of one species, or a signature mix\u2014the choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460890/extras/gif2.gif?t=1749746234\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Dry your mushrooms</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chop firewood, light the stove, and dry mushrooms over the coals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460890/extras/gif3.gif?t=1749746234\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3460890?t=1749746234","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3460890?t=1749746234","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460890/f490f5a6f13994cb112906705fb8de02c5671bf5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749746234","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460890/f490f5a6f13994cb112906705fb8de02c5671bf5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749746234","categories":[{"description":"Single-player"